{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":5,"result":{"label":"json","kind":9,"data":{"uri":"file://tests/fixtures/lsp_ws/resolve/main.z","line":10,"base":""},"sortText":"4json","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"```zerolang\njson: unit\n```\n\njson -- JSON (RFC 8259) value tree, parser, and serializer.\nThe tree is a reftype tagged sum (`Value`) mirroring the AST's\nunion-of-carriers shape: scalars ride in the arm payload, arrays\nand objects in carrier classes. Objects remember key insertion\norder (`keys`) so serialization is deterministic; `entries` gives\nO(1) lookup. Integers and floats are separate arms so i64 values\n(protocol ids, offsets) round-trip exactly."}}}
